    "story": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "story_heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Designed for Intentional Living",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "story_content": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We believe journaling is more than putting words on paper — it is a powerful tool for reflection, creativity, and personal growth. That is why every Velvet Journal Co product is designed around one idea: make it easy for you to sit down, slow down, and write down what matters. Beautiful paper, considered layouts, and prompts that keep you moving forward.</p><p>Whether you are building gratitude habits, working towards your goals, or simply making space for your thoughts, there is a journal for that. Start with the collection that meets you where you are.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "story_heading",
        "story_content"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "separate_section_with_border": true,
        "content_width": "md",
        "text_position": "center",
        "remove_vertical_spacing": false
      }
    },
    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does delivery take?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders are delivered within 3-7 business days. You will receive a tracking link by email as soon as your parcel leaves our studio.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return a journal or planner?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. You have 14 days to return unused items in their original packaging. Send us a message through our contact page and we will arrange the return for you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What kind of paper do you use?",
            "answer": "<p>Our journals are printed on smooth, fountain-pen friendly paper that resists bleeding and keeps fine detail crisp, so you can write with any pen you prefer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I choose my delivery date?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. At checkout you can select the delivery date that suits you best, and we will make sure your order arrives on the day you choose.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "question_1",
        "question_2",
        "question_3",
        "question_4"
      ],
